# Lab 1: Network Connectivity Verification & ARP Analysis

## Overview

This lab focuses on verifying network communication between a Windows 11 virtual machine and a Kali Linux virtual machine. The objective was to understand basic network troubleshooting, observe ARP address resolution, and analyze ICMP traffic using Wireshark.

This forms the foundation for SOC operations, where analysts frequently investigate connectivity issues, suspicious communication, and network-level events.

---

# Lab Objectives

- Verify IP configuration of Windows and Kali Linux VMs
- Test network connectivity between hosts
- Capture and analyze ARP traffic using Wireshark
- Understand how IP addresses are resolved to MAC addresses
- Analyze ICMP Echo Request and Echo Reply packets

